cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "deposit.mayday.software"
message: >-
  Signed, timestamped authorship attestation for the deposit.mayday.software website.
  Verify the detached GPG signature (CITATION.cff.asc) against the published
  public key (pubkey.asc) to prove WHO, and the OpenTimestamps proof
  (CITATION.cff.ots) to prove WHEN. Verify locally at
  https://deposit.mayday.software/authorship — files never leave your browser.
abstract: >-
  deposit — open-source cryptographic copyright deposit: files are hashed in the
  browser and the proof is anchored in Bitcoin (OpenTimestamps) and RFC 3161
  timestamping authorities. This file is a cryptographic authorship attestation,
  not the source: the GPG signature proves it was issued by Ilia Arestov
  (code@ilia.ae) and the OpenTimestamps anchor proves the date.
authors:
  - given-names: Ilia
    family-names: Arestov
    email: code@ilia.ae
url: "https://deposit.mayday.software"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ilia-ae/deposit.mayday.software"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-07"
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - deposit
  - authorship
  - attestation
  - gpg
  - openpgp
  - opentimestamps
  - sha256
